43	 * setting in this renderer -- every test in this class gets 'Authorization: Bearer
44	 * <realtoken>' auto-injected before any test-specific headers, with no per-test override
45	 * and no reliable way to suppress/replace a catalog-injected header (RestAssured would send
46	 * two Authorization header lines; which one the server reads first is not something this
47	 * suite should depend on). That means the missing-header / malformed-Bearer-prefix
48	 * (extractBearer) and invalid/expired-token (AuthService.me) 401 branches CANNOT be
